{"3286430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "THE REVENANTS", "steam_appid": 3286430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE REVENANTS</strong> is a hardcore turn—based survival story generator   with elements of strategy. Hide from the poisonous fog, fight the mutants and try to save your life. Fight for existence, destroy mutants, avoid infected areas and prove what you are capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the harsh open world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search residential buildings, shops, cars and pharmacies in automatic or manual mode. Find weapons, equipment, supplies — everything that will help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/208d5d619c911240081eb85da741b8f1.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/208d5d619c911240081eb85da741b8f1.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/208d5d619c911240081eb85da741b8f1.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for your life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter many mutant enemies on your way, which you will have to destroy at all costs. Can you handle it, or will they be stronger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/66357fa2d9bf4c91d68f1c2fd3abbe72.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/66357fa2d9bf4c91d68f1c2fd3abbe72.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/66357fa2d9bf4c91d68f1c2fd3abbe72.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try to survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your group's vital signs: health, satiety, thirst, energy, radiation levels. If their level drops to critical, you will become easy prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/60af5284f3a6ed7afc390a25aa52857d.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/60af5284f3a6ed7afc390a25aa52857d.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/60af5284f3a6ed7afc390a25aa52857d.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from the acid fog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the global map and do everything possible to avoid encountering the radioactive fog. You can't stay in one place for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d72ac076017dc2fed3fb269917fcf9f8.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d72ac076017dc2fed3fb269917fcf9f8.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d72ac076017dc2fed3fb269917fcf9f8.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose a weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of weapons, from homemade spears to shotguns. You will definitely find what you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/ca1edb638f35b613daee1b01864f145c.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/ca1edb638f35b613daee1b01864f145c.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/ca1edb638f35b613daee1b01864f145c.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be able to take everything you find with you — you'll have to take only the most necessary things. Distribute items in your inventory, try to combine the collected materials and create new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/abf9528d67f8b215a9f6526ffd9ad3df.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/abf9528d67f8b215a9f6526ffd9ad3df.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/abf9528d67f8b215a9f6526ffd9ad3df.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/75a01d3bba468006b82af4830f9c3b0c.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/75a01d3bba468006b82af4830f9c3b0c.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE REVENANTS</strong> is a hardcore turn—based survival story generator   with elements of strategy. Hide from the poisonous fog, fight the mutants and try to save your life. Fight for existence, destroy mutants, avoid infected areas and prove what you are capable of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the harsh open world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search residential buildings, shops, cars and pharmacies in automatic or manual mode. Find weapons, equipment, supplies — everything that will help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/208d5d619c911240081eb85da741b8f1.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/208d5d619c911240081eb85da741b8f1.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/208d5d619c911240081eb85da741b8f1.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for your life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter many mutant enemies on your way, which you will have to destroy at all costs. Can you handle it, or will they be stronger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/66357fa2d9bf4c91d68f1c2fd3abbe72.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/66357fa2d9bf4c91d68f1c2fd3abbe72.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/66357fa2d9bf4c91d68f1c2fd3abbe72.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try to survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your group's vital signs: health, satiety, thirst, energy, radiation levels. If their level drops to critical, you will become easy prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/60af5284f3a6ed7afc390a25aa52857d.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/60af5284f3a6ed7afc390a25aa52857d.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/60af5284f3a6ed7afc390a25aa52857d.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from the acid fog</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the global map and do everything possible to avoid encountering the radioactive fog. You can't stay in one place for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d72ac076017dc2fed3fb269917fcf9f8.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d72ac076017dc2fed3fb269917fcf9f8.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d72ac076017dc2fed3fb269917fcf9f8.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose a weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of weapons, from homemade spears to shotguns. You will definitely find what you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/ca1edb638f35b613daee1b01864f145c.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/ca1edb638f35b613daee1b01864f145c.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/ca1edb638f35b613daee1b01864f145c.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be able to take everything you find with you — you'll have to take only the most necessary things. Distribute items in your inventory, try to combine the collected materials and create new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/abf9528d67f8b215a9f6526ffd9ad3df.poster.avif?t=1770177491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/abf9528d67f8b215a9f6526ffd9ad3df.webm?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/abf9528d67f8b215a9f6526ffd9ad3df.mp4?t=1770177491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 